# The vendored `wit-bindgen` CLI, the C bindings it generates from crates/gg/wit, the staging tree
# the guest archive is cut from, and the AST dump the catalogue is reflected out of. Everything this
# package COMMITS lands in crates/gg/src/sandbox/checkers/ and
# crates/gg/src/sandbox/guests/cpp.signatures.json instead.
.build/

# The reflector is a script rather than a package; nothing imports it twice in one process, so the
# cache is noise.
tools/__pycache__/
